om/media/share/dir-7j7wv-7f4b824 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> To accompany the Hunter the Vigil 2nd Edition Kickstarter by Onyx Path Publishing, we have an interview with developer Monica Valentinelli to talk about what to expect from the second edition. We talk about development, mechanics, and the feels and heart of Hunter. Hunter will be on Kickstarter today (2/6/2020). You can find Monica on Twitter @booksofm. Her website is www.booksofm.com. Flames Rising is @flamesrising. That site is www.flamesrising.com. Want to join the conversation? Join us on Discord: https://discord.gg/gPVH7a9&nbsp; To help support the show, share it, or rate and review on your podcast service of choice. To support us financially, please donate on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/thestorytold&nbsp; Our music is composed by James Horan. To contact him regarding composition, send him an email:&nbsp;<a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"92f8fafde0f3fcababd2fde2e6fdfcfefbfcf7bcfcf7e6\">[email&#160;protected]</a> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-06-2020, 02:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-05T23:59:01-08:00","id":1365674,"title":"","content":"Story Told podcast did interview of Monica Valentinelli, lead designer of <b>Hunter: the Vigil</b> 2E on this game edition - here it is. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.podbean.com/media/share/dir-7j7wv-7f4b824\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://ssl-static.libsyn.com/p/assets/f/a/1/4/fa147fc90d3d3a3d/Hunter.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.podbean.com/media/share/dir-7j7wv-7f4b824\" target=\"_blank\"> Bonus 23 - Hunter the Vigil 2nd Edition Developer Interview with Monica Valentinelli </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.podbean.com/media/share/dir-7j7wv-7f4b824\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.podbean.com/media/share/dir-7j7wv-7f4b824 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> To accompany the Hunter the Vigil 2nd Edition Kickstarter by Onyx Path Publishing, we have an interview with developer Monica Valentinelli to talk about what to expect from the second edition. We talk about development, mechanics, and the feels and heart of Hunter. Hunter will be on Kickstarter today (2/6/2020). You can find Monica on Twitter @booksofm. Her website is www.booksofm.com. Flames Rising is @flamesrising. That site is www.flamesrising.com. Want to join the conversation? Join us on Discord: https://discord.gg/gPVH7a9&nbsp; To help support the show, share it, or rate and review on your podcast service of choice. To support us financially, please donate on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/thestorytold&nbsp; Our music is composed by James Horan. To contact him regarding composition, send him an email:&nbsp;<a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"056f6d6a77646b3c3c456a75716a6b696c6b602b6b6071\">[email&#160;protected]</a> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> More info on the interview - in it's own topic on forum - here - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1365708-hunter-kicksterter-podcast-interview-with-line-developer-monica-valentinelli\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-valentinelli</a><br /> <br /> From the interview with Monica:<br /> 1. She mentioned she did get problem with integrating her vision of <b>HtV</b> 2E with larger rulesets of <b>CoD</b> 2E gamelines - so she employed Daniel Lauzone to help her on the matter, as Daniel is experiences rules developer for whole <b>CoD</b> line. ( My suspicion: ) It's probably why we had one year silence on the <b>HtV </b>2E front from devs.<br /> 2. Hunters should get a large powerboost from 1E, as monsters are more powerful.<br /> 3. Cancer Cells are much more prevailing as their is much more monsters now. Metaphor for hunters community is modern Internet and it's constant online arguing ( but agreeing on need of cats on GIFs ). <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-06-2020, 11:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T06:55:29-08:00","id":1365716,"title":"","content":"Forgive my ignorance, but what are cancer cells? I can't listen to the podcast at the moment, otherwise I assume that would have been answered.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12738-minty","name":"Minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T07:01:17-08:00","id":1365717,"title":"","content":"From <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/TabletopGame/HunterTheVigil\" target=\"_blank\">TV Tropes page on HtV</a>:<br /> <i><b>Cancer cell </b>- which, in the <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/VanHelsingHateCrimes\" target=\"_blank\">Van Helsing Hate Crimes</a> terminology of <b>Hunter</b>, means a cell with a supernatural being having unofficial membership or at least a close friendship</i>.<br /> <br /> Cancer Cells are called by other cells when they are 'biased' by some monsters races, at least in other hunters opinions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-06-2020, 10:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T07:06:45-08:00","id":1365719,"title":"","content":"Oh, that's interesting. Thank you for the reply!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12738-minty","name":"Minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T11:14:07-08:00","id":1365769,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/339646881/hunter-the-vigil-second-edition-tabletop-roleplaying-game\" target=\"_blank\">The hunt has begun\u2026</a> <br /> ( Kickstarter have started, 1<sup>st</sup> PDF preview is shared! )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T11:31:03-08:00","id":1365779,"title":"","content":"Jemes Bell is pointing we will have <b>Compacts &amp; Conspiracies</b> posts in coming weeks. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <i>We\u2019ll dig more into those topics over the next several Backers-Only updates, with regular Compact &amp; Conspiracy posts.</i><ul><li><i>Feb 8 \u2013 Long Night &amp; Ascending Ones</i></li> <li><i>Feb 10 \u2013 Loyalists of Thule &amp; The Cheiron Group</i></li> <li><i>Feb 12 \u2013 Network Zero &amp; Council of Bones</i></li> <li><i>Feb 14 \u2013 Null Mysteriis &amp; The Lucifuge</i></li> <li><i>Feb 17 \u2013 SWORN &amp; Malleus Malificarum</i></li> <li><i>Feb 19 \u2013 The Union &amp; Task Force: VALKYRIE</i></li> <li><i>Feb 21 \u2013 Nine Stars &amp; VASCU</i></li> </ul><i>Over the next 2 weeks, we\u2019ll visit with each of the organizations detailed within this book. There\u2019s a lot of content, but it\u2019ll be coming in bite-sized sections. After we work through the Compacts &amp; Conspiracies, we\u2019ll dig into the rules, character creation, monsters, locations, Storyteller guidance, and outline a Chronicle for your game. By the end, we\u2019ll have posted every word in the current manuscript \u2013 you\u2019ll be able to read along and see exactly what this book contains and how it\u2019s put together.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-06-2020, 02:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T11:36:37-08:00","id":1365781,"title":"","content":"*reads opening quote*<br /> Oh yeah, we're not going to have any issues here. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T11:43:27-08:00","id":1365783,"title":"","content":"Backed<br /> <br /> Bear Lodge Represent","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Didn't anyone ever tell you not to bring claws to a gun fight?</span></b><br /><br />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3786-leicsfox","name":"LeicsFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3786_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T11:45:30-08:00","id":1365784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365467#post1365467\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes to the latter, no to the former. The Code underlines a <i>priority</i> between the two, but being a monster hunter and then privileging a monster's safety over a human's is a point of failure that doesn't require you to take a stake to every vampire you know of to avoid it. This is still a gameline where &quot;monster reformer&quot; is a valid aim for a cell or character.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Perhaps, but reading this piece of text doesn't seem like in Second Edition there is much wiggle room for playing a &quot;monster reformer&quot;:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Calling a Spade a Spade</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">What happens if the characters encounter a sympathetic monster, like the vampire who refuses to feed on human blood or the ghost that\u2019s just trying to communicate? What about mundane serial killers, aren\u2019t they just as bad as any creepy critter?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">The Code doesn\u2019t care. By taking up the Vigil, a hunter decides that humanity is Us and monsters are Them, though he may lie to himself or wish it were otherwise. When the chips are down, a human being belongs on Earth and a vampire doesn\u2019t, period. When the Code gets in the way of empathy for the plight of a creature that had no choice in becoming what it is, or one that\u2019s trying its best not to harm anybody, it forces a hunter to confront the consequences of the Vigil he swore to uphold. Likewise, when the Code says it\u2019s wrong to hunt the lady next door even though she\u2019s a heartless murderer, it exposes the fine line he walks in no uncertain terms.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">It may not seem fair, but without the Code, a hunter is just a butcher with friends. He has to draw the line somewhere. He might want to view the cooperative vampire as a person, but in his heart, he knows that letting such a creature roam free puts all of humanity at the mercy of a danger it doesn\u2019t understand. He can suck it up and carry the Vigil, or cross the line and face the music.<br /> </span></span> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><br /> <br /> But time will tell what the actual finished 2e product will provide us with. Personally I hope you're right Satchel.</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25286-tomorrow-s-nobody","name":"Tomorrow's Nobody","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25286_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T11:47:07-08:00","id":1365785,"title":"","content":"IT&quot;S HERE!!!!!!!!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T11:49:31-08:00","id":1365786,"title":"","content":"Also, it seems that I'm getting the Loyalists and Cheiron as a birthday present. Oh, Hunter, you shouldn't have... seriously, you shouldn't. Keep those organ thieves out of me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T11:50:01-08:00","