er one players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1870-mlvalentine","name":"mlvalentine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1870_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T12:55:08-08:00","id":1365818,"title":"","content":"Having skimmed through the preview multiple times now, I've failed to find any explanation for what separates hunters from regular people aside from their occupation. What is it that bestows the hunter template on hunters?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T12:58:39-08:00","id":1365820,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365818#post1365818\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Having skimmed through the preview multiple times now, I've failed to find any explanation for what separates hunters from regular people aside from their occupation. What is it that bestows the hunter template on hunters?</div> </div> </div> </div>Their commitment. Truly anyone can be a hunter, but what separates them from another person after their first encounter with the supernatural is their willingness to uphold the Vigil and make the sacrifices required. Once they do that, then they become a hunter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1870-mlvalentine","name":"mlvalentine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1870_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T13:09:42-08:00","id":1365822,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365818#post1365818\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Having skimmed through the preview multiple times now, I've failed to find any explanation for what separates hunters from regular people aside from their occupation. What is it that bestows the hunter template on hunters?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Code, which alters Integrity, and the ability to risk Willpower. It isn't in here because it's in Character Creation. The point is that it's not that extreme a shift. As it was in 1E.<br /> <br /> Also: Holy shit, the Slasher-hunting Compact are Chinese crime drama cops.<br /> <br /> This is fucking awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T13:22:24-08:00","id":1365824,"title":"","content":"Wow, it basically already reached the goal","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18090-ruger","name":"Ruger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18090_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T13:33:48-08:00","id":1365826,"title":"","content":"Well, reading the part about the Abbey, I can see what really relegated them to the example. Not their habits, but the fact they are Scottish.<br /> <br /> Well, that and their habits too, but given how they're already drunkards and high, a certain caliber of player is going to try to make the ST's hair fall out, and use them to walk up to an abyssal cult demanding the return of their lawn gnomes.<br /> <br /> (Look up Old Man Henderson, if you don't get the reference.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":". 02-06-2020, 04:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T13:34:32-08:00","id":1365827,"title":"","content":"... and it's funded! In 2,5 hours only!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T14:07:25-08:00","id":1365835,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365796#post1365796\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As Monica said over on the KS comments: &quot;Ashwood Abbey is presented in the Storyteller chapter to show how to make a compact. It is not one of the full splats.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I wrote it before reading the preview, and once I started I more or less lost contact with the world. It is really awesome!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T14:08:39-08:00","id":1365836,"title":"","content":"Because of Kickstarter, I want to end - finally - my <i>Supernatural</i> TV series watching. I paused in half of Season 13 - so will probably got to the end of Season 15 by the end of <b>HtV</b> 2E Kickstarter in one month. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> #WinchestersChallange","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-06-2020, 05:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T14:22:47-08:00","id":1365839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365822#post1365822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Code, which alters Integrity, and the ability to risk Willpower. It isn't in here because it's in Character Creation. The point is that it's not that extreme a shift. As it was in 1E.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know know the difference between hunters and regular people, just not why they are. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mlvalentine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365820#post1365820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Their commitment. Truly anyone can be a hunter, but what separates them from another person after their first encounter with the supernatural is their willingness to uphold the Vigil and make the sacrifices required. Once they do that, then they become a hunter.</div> </div> </div> </div>And determination alone grants the ability to risk Willpower and changes how their Integrity works? That's generally indicative of a significant metaphysical change in CofD. As in, their literal souls have changed in some way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T14:36:28-08:00","id":1365844,"title":"","content":"I see that 2E is making some cleanings and merging of Hunter Orgs - like all members are reassigned to Task Force: VALKYRIE now from Barrett Commission, Division Six and Merrick Institute, It has sense, as sometimes I thought some Conspiracies in 1E were made only to have the same trope with diffrent monster focus. Like here, 'vampires USA goverment group', 'mages USA goverment group' and 'beast USA goverment group' - in those examples.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T14:36:35-08:00","id":1365845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365839#post1365839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> And determination alone grants the ability to risk Willpower and changes how their Integrity works? That's generally indicative of a significant metaphysical change in CofD. As in, their literal souls have changed in some way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just as they were in first edition, hunters are regular people and are not supernatural. The rules are a mechanical expression of their commitment to the Vigil.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1870-mlvalentine","name":"mlvalentine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1870_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T14:51:03-08:00","id":1365848,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365844#post1365844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see that 2E is making some cleanings and merging of Hunter Orgs - like all members are reassigned to Task Force: VALKYRIE now from Barrett Commission, Division Six and Merrick Institute, It has sense, as sometimes I thought some Conspiracies in 1E were made only to have the same trope with diffrent monster focus. Like here, 'vampires USA goverment group', 'mages USA goverment group' and 'beast USA goverment group' - in those examples.</div> </div> </div> </div>While the Commission makes sense for the merge, and Division Six somewhat makes sense (as they were not, according to their writeup, actually a part of the US government, but instead dupes of the Seers of the Throne), the Merrick Institution were not a part of it at all- unless you talk about the original conspiracy which did the experiments on the children. The new Merrick, that is, the children themselves, have no ties to the government what so ever, and were actually hunting the branches of the original group- more of Deviant focused conspiracy than Beast, actually. So if it is the original conspiracy it makers sense, if it is the runaway children not so much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T14:56:39-08:00","id":1365851,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365844#post1365844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see that 2E is making some cleanings and merging of Hunter Orgs - like all members are reassigned to Task Force: VALKYRIE now from Barrett Commission, Division Six and Merrick Institute, It has sense, as sometimes I thought some Conspiracies in 1E were made only to have the same trope with diffrent monster focus. Like here, 'vampires USA goverment group', 'mages USA goverment group' and 'beast USA goverment group' - in those examples.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Barrett Commission and Division Six were compacts and I imagine being absorbed into a conspiracy is a better end than most compacts get.<br /> <br /> The Merrick Institute is an interesting one in this case; the actual Hunters were effectively Renegades who still fought the Beast they were created fight after breaking off from the amoral research group that created them. So if there was anything that was salvaged after the Inquiry, it WASN'T Hunter personal. Research scientists and techs, maybe but not the children turned psychonaunts. Those guys were probably the leek that got the Institute shut down.<br /> <br /> Mind you if the US government had to shut down their shady astral research program for PR reasons, I think their other psychic program for Hunters (VASCU) might be a better fit for the scavenging rights. But that is outside the scope of this preview anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T14:57:12-08:00","id":1365852,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365839#post1365839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And determination alone grants the ability to risk Willpower and changes how their Integrity works? That's generally indicative of a significant metaphysical change in CofD. As in, their literal souls have changed in some way.</div> </div> </div> </div>I personally like to think about hunters to mortals as archmasters to mages- that is, an &quot;evolved template&quot;. Hunters are still mortals, but their commitment to the Vigil has changed their minds- and perhaps their souls- in some way. They have changed, but not by becoming inhuman- if anything by becoming more human, living manifestation of humanity's desperate hope and bleak desires.<br /> <br /> Slashers, on the other hand, is an actual transformation of the soul- the light burns out, and only darkness remains. They do become something else, by losing anything which once turned them human and having nothing to fill the void but killing.<br /> <br /> Again, just my personal view of the hunter state.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T15:03:51-08:00","id":1365854,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365848#post1365848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While the Commission makes sense for the merge, and Division Six somewhat makes sense (as they were not, according to their writeup, actually a part of the US government, but instead dupes of the Seers of the Throne), the Merrick Institution were not a part of it at all- unless you talk about the original conspiracy which did the experiments on the children. The new Merrick, that is, the children themselves, have no ties to the government what so ever, and were actually hunting the branches of the original group- more of Deviant focused conspiracy than Beast, actually. So if it is the original conspiracy it makers sense, if it is the runaway children not so much.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, the point of the Merrick Institute is to be the kids in the third Nightmare on Elm Street movie. You can\u2019t do that with VALKYRIE.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 02-06-2020, 06:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T15:19:48-08:00","id":1365856,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365854#post1365854\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, the point of the Merrick Institute is to be the kids in the third Friday the 13th movie. You can\u2019t do that with VALKYRIE.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nightmare on Elm Street.<br /> <br /> It seems they have changed history somewhat. The Les Voyegeurs turned might have turned into the Bear Lodge which then got folded into the new Abby. So maybe the whole runaway kids thing never happened. It also doesn't say they were folded in but were just shut down after what they did came to light.<br /> <br /> Is there any chance some on the other compacts and conspiracies will get a write up? maybe in the stretch goals?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T15:26:48-08:00","id":1365858,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grimmi05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365856#post1365856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It seems they have changed history somewhat. The Les Voyegeurs turned might have turned into the Bear Lodge which then got folded into the new Abby. So maybe the whole runaway kids thing never happened. It also doesn't say they were folded in but were just shut down after what they did came to light.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Like, Merrick getting shut down does not outright contradicts the existence of the runaway children organization. In fact, it does go well with their history, especially considering a Deviant crossover. The confusion is mostly from the fact we have two groups which were called Merrick, and we don't know to which the timeline refers to.<br /> <br /> And they didn't changed the history as much as they expanded it and advanced it in time. TFV absorbing Division Six and the Commission, as well as the Bear Lodge combining with the Ashwood Abbey, seems to be recent events, and connections between the Les Voyegeurs and the Bear Lodge (which may or may not be true, even according to the history section) has been suggested since Dark Eras was presented.<br /> <br /> In short, considering that the history of hunters seems to be murky and confusing and with the recent changes in organizations, I can't say that anything in here outright invalidate the known history of Hunter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T15:34:05-08:00","id":1365859,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365858#post1365858\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Like, Merrick getting shut down does not outright contradicts the existence of the runaway children organization. In fact, it does go well with their history, especially considering a Deviant crossover. The confusion is mostly from the fact we have two groups which were called Merrick, and we don't know to which the timeline refers to.<br /> <br /> And they didn't changed the history as much as they expanded it and advanced it in time. TFV absorbing Division Six and the Commission, as well as the Bear Lodge combining with the Ashwood Abbey, seems to be recent events, and connections between the Les Voyegeurs and the Bear Lodge (which may or may not be true, even according to the history section) has been suggested since Dark Eras was presented.<br /> <br /> In short, considering that the history of hunters seems to be murky and confusing and with the recent changes in organizations, I can't say that anything in here outright invalidate the known history of Hunter.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, the current Merrick Institute is literally their victims wearing their name and skin; all this history does is justify why they're not especially willing to trust TFV even more, because a few of them may be salvaged researchers. Whether or not the researchers were the ones who wanted to stop the experiments depends on how heroic TFV is in your game. Still, interesting diversification they've had; TFV now seems like a clearing house for everything the US government does related to the supernatural world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T15:35:43-08:00","id":1365861,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365858#post1365858\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Like, Merrick getting shut down does not outright contradicts the existence of the runaway children organization. In fact, it does go well with their history, especially considering a Deviant crossover. The confusion is mostly from the fact we have two groups which were called Merrick, and we don't know to which the timeline refers to.<br /> <br /> And they didn't changed the history as much as they expanded it and advanced it in time. TFV absorbing Division Six and the Commission, as well as the Bear Lodge combining with the Ashwood Abbey, seems to be recent events, and connections between the Les Voyegeurs and the Bear Lodge (which may or may not be true, even according to the history section) has been suggested since Dark Eras was presented.<br /> <br /> In short, considering that the history of hunters seems to be murky and confusing and with the recent changes in organizations, I can't say that anything in here outright invalidate the known history of Hunter.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's why I said Maybe it didn't happen. the whole runaway kids thing maybe what brought the whole thing to light and cause it to shut down. we at this time don't have a clear answer to that.<br /> <br /> And The Bear Lodge and Abby themselves have vastly different goals(though we don't know what changed for the Abby yet.) While big game hunters and rich people do have some overlap the Bear Lodge seemed more focused on the hunting aspect then the whole drug, sex, and money thing that the Abby was known for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T15:42:59-08:00","id":1365863,"title":"","content":"time out. so Barret and division 6 are not their own compacts, bear lodge and ashwood abbey are merged?<br /> <br /> I'm not gonna lie. I'm not a fan of that, not at all. still backed though","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T15:44:27-08:00","id":1365864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tomorrow's Nobody</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365784#post1365784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Perhaps, but reading this piece of text doesn't seem like in Second Edition there is much wiggle room for playing a &quot;monster reformer&quot;:</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1154066-hunter-2ed-the-code?p=1154907#post1154907\">I had this conversation two years ago</a> and I'm not terribly eager to rehash it:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1154066-hunter-2ed-the-code?p=1154907#post1154907\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;When the chips are down&quot; does not mean &quot;at the drop of a hat.&quot;<br /> <br /> The vast majority of sapient monsters for whom wrongdoing is a concern are liable to understand that showing off their supernatural qualities is damaging to the human psyche to the point where most of them have at least an institutional mandate against such revelations if not an internal consequence for breaking that secrecy. Most of the ones y'all're expressing concern over will generally have ample room to provide evidence against their doing wrong. If they've gotten caught out as a monster, you're at the point where their doing harm is on the table and the Code says that you have to <i>treat them as a concern</i> \u2014 and therefore at least <i>keep an eye on them</i> and be prepared for the possibility that you have to put them down if they get worse instead of better \u2014 or take their word that it won't happen again and leave the possibility open that they break your trust.<br /> <br /> That's an incentive to not leave monsters alone once you're aware of them, which installs them in your character's notional relationship web about as solidly as your character's Touchstones. The base dichotomy of your gut telling you to kill-or-confine things that break with mundane reality regardless of how personable they are is there to feed into the drama of hunters struggling with trust as a scarce commodity in the Chronicles of Darkness, not to Force Your Character To Kill Varney The Harmless Ratsucker just because Jack The Egomaniac down at the Abbey has no problem doing so.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T15:55:13-08:00","id":1365867,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365863#post1365863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">time out. so Barret and division 6 are not their own compacts, bear lodge and ashwood abbey are merged?<br /> <br /> I'm not gonna lie. I'm not a fan of that, not at all. still backed though</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly the Bear Lodge already pretty much was doing the Abbey\u2019s thing without sex crimes, so combining them as you move away from that element for the Abbey makes sense.<br /> <br /> I\u2019ve always felt that Division VI was a good idea in the wrong gameline. The best place for deluded reality defenders (riffing on Ascension Technocrats) was a Banisher Cult.<br /> <br /> Barrett Commission I think there should still be a place for, but refocused on the private sector and corridors of wealth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T15:56:41-08:00","id":1365869,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grimmi05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365856#post1365856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nightmare on Elm Street.</div> </div> </div> </div>Whoops, fixed","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T16:09:54-08:00","id":1365873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365867#post1365867\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Honestly the Bear Lodge already pretty much was doing the Abbey\u2019s thing without sex crimes, so combining them as you move away from that element for the Abbey makes sense.<br /> <br /> I\u2019ve always felt that Division VI was a good idea in the wrong gameline. The best place for deluded reality defenders (riffing on Ascension Technocrats) was a Banisher Cult.<br /> <br /> Barrett Commission I think there should still be a place for, but refocused on the private sector and corridors of wealth.</div> </div> </div> </div>I always say the Bear Lodge and the Abby as the same side of two different coins. As in they were both sport hunters but for different reasons. THe lodge because they wanted to prove that they were the best hunters and the Abby because what do you do when you can buy anything you could ever want. It will be interesting to see what they do with the Abby because I still believe there is a place for bored people with too much money and too much time in Hunter. a group that follows the code and upholds the Vigil not because of revenge or to protect someone but because they are rich idiots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T16:33:56-08:00","id":1365887,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365867#post1365867\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Honestly the Bear Lodge already pretty much was doing the Abbey\u2019s thing without sex crimes, so combining them as you move away from that element for the Abbey makes sense.<br /> <br /> I\u2019ve always felt that Division VI was a good idea in the wrong gameline. The best place for deluded reality defenders (riffing on Ascension Technocrats) was a Banisher Cult.<br /> <br /> Barrett Commission I think there should still be a place for, but refocused on the private sector and corridors of wealth.</div> </div> </div> </div>the abbey wants you to have excitement in whatever way possible, to stave off the ennui of they all suffer from. they will do anything to accomplish this, from socializing with all the monsters, making the finest of haute cuisine using beastly ingredients, and yes, kill them if that's all you need.<br /> <br /> the bear lodge is about hunting the most dangerous prey, to prove your worth and say you killed worthy prey. they had a mindset even a werewolf could respect. they are practical, and care only for the hunt.<br /> <br /> I know I'm romanticizing, but they are only similar if you see the abbey at corebook incarnation. the Barret commission was composed of 3 factions made to stave off the supernatural in the three biggest aspects of human society. the political, big business, and military complex. it was perfect what they consisted of (and it's more unified than the 3 factions of the Ascending ones, in terms of what they do, I mean). the whole reason division 6 was beloved was not in spite of being a fake gov. group, but BECAUSE it consisted of people really believing they were secret government hunters, being both a subversion and deconstruction of the government conspiracy. now they are just that, another government conspiracy.<br /> <br /> I just disagree with taking away organizations that were perfectly in the modern world last edition","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T16:46:27-08:00","id":1365889,"title":"","content":"Wasn't Division Six not even with the government but was ran by a seer of the Panopticon? or was it run by the government lead by a seer of the Panopticon?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T16:52:01-08:00","id":1365891,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grimmi05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365889#post1365889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wasn't Division Six not even with the government but was ran by a seer of the Panopticon? or was it run by the government lead by a seer of the Panopticon?</div> </div> </div> </div>it was ran by mister Jones, a member of the panopticon. he claimed it was a secret government group and showed the original hunters their &quot;surveillance&quot; tech. from then on, he used gov. conspiracy trappings to trick them into being dupes","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T16:52:40-08:00","id":1365892,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grimmi05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365889#post1365889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wasn't Division Six not even with the government but was ran by a seer of the Panopticon? or was it run by the government lead by a seer of the Panopticon?</div> </div> </div> </div>They were not with the government in any way, shape or form. The governmental angle was a smokescreen for people on the street and, ironically, the government.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T17:06:59-08:00","id":1365895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365839#post1365839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And determination alone grants the ability to risk Willpower and changes how their Integrity works? That's generally indicative of a significant metaphysical change in CofD. As in, their literal souls have changed in some way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Significant enough psychological changes can warrant that level of change as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T18:30:07-08:00","id":1365903,"title":"","content":"Was planning on backing but that Feb 2022 delivery date is an issue for me. I've been burned by many OP Kickstarters before when it came to release, so I think I'm going to sit this one out and wait for the PDF--whenever that may come.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T19:10:03-08:00","id":1365916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fat Larry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365903#post1365903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Was planning on backing but that Feb 2022 delivery date is an issue for me. I've been burned by many OP Kickstarters before when it came to release, so I think I'm going to sit this one out and wait for the PDF--whenever that may come.</div> </div> </div> </div>They put very far out delivery date because of trying to allow for unforeseen delays. The text is done (sans editing) and being shared with Backers, so it\u2019s not an Exalted 3E, Scion 2E, or Wraith 20 situation where an unplanned systems rewrite, or author\u2019s personal life, can get in the way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"da