le":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T19:23:02-08:00","id":1365923,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grimmi05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365920#post1365920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean all that stuff already happened which is why the kickstarter is just now happening<br /> <br /> Yeah I am interested in seeing the new compacts as well. what does the Nine stars do that isn't just VASCU with no psychic powers and in Hong Kong?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> My guess, given the crime dramas they are pretty obviously inspired by, is bust organized crime and work outside the law. And maybe know mundane kung fu, but I think that may be provincial of a white man to think so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T19:41:42-08:00","id":1365926,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365923#post1365923\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> My guess, given the crime dramas they are pretty obviously inspired by, is bust organized crime and work outside the law. And maybe know mundane kung fu, but I think that may be provincial of a white man to think so.</div> </div> </div> </div>yeah but then why have that be in CoD? I am guessing they are going to be hunting slashers of some sort. I guess we will just have to wait till the end of the month to find out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T19:45:45-08:00","id":1365927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365923#post1365923\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> My guess, given the crime dramas they are pretty obviously inspired by, is bust organized crime and work outside the law. And maybe know mundane kung fu, but I think that may be provincial of a white man to think so.</div> </div> </div> </div>if the cops know kung fu, even I will call Onyx Path out for blatant stereotyping lol. though regarding <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24179_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24179\" data-vbnamecard=\"24179\">Grimmi05</a> question, The police of Hong Kong operate much differently from the US or others (all police forces operate differently. for example, British police are more public helpers, german police take the law VERY seriously, american police are on edge). I'm sure the 9 stars will have a much different feel, especially when you take pop culture views into account<br /> <br /> EDIT: regarding the british police, when I say &quot;public helpers&quot; I dont mean they could do nothing in a conflict. they very much can stop criminals. what i mean is that that the public is not only comfortable around them, but can ask them questions regarding directions and stuff. much different from the US, where the men in blue on patrol are not to be bothered unless alerted to a crime.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24173,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","user":"Primordial newcomer","date":". 02-06-2020, 10:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T20:13:13-08:00","id":1365929,"title":"","content":"Monsters are often criminals and in many cases put themselves in positions that make them untouchable through lawful methods, like by being rich or influential.<br /> <br /> An option for police as protagonists in a supernatural story isn't exactly unheard of. Sam &amp; Twitch, Death Valley, Wellington Paranormal. Even first edition had Tales of the 13th Precinct.<br /> <br /> Law enforcement also offers a nice infrastructure to work off of as a compact.<br /> <br /> VASCU, alternatively, was just focused on slashers. The core conspiracies and compacts in first edition might have had their preferences, but the groups introduced outside of that were pretty focused. Maybe we'll get a group that only hunts one specific monster but that would be sort of alienating to use in the core.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 02-06-2020, 11:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T20:27:31-08:00","id":1365931,"title":"","content":"And Hunter just burned through its first stretch goal (GM's Screen)! I barely even got to check what the stretch goals were!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeli