de_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365892#post1365892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They were not with the government in any way, shape or form. The governmental angle was a smokescreen for people on the street and, ironically, the government.</div> </div> </div> </div>That last one, tricking the government into thinking it was part of the government is probably how it got absorbed. I can see TF:V tracking down &quot;rogue&quot; Division 6 agents and informing them that the Division is to be absorbed into the Taskforce after they realize that the memo didn't get through.<br /> <br /> Jones did is not having a good time as of late. All that effort, gone...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T02:35:06-08:00","id":1365973,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1365972#post1365972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wait, what? WHERE? I need to see this!</div> </div> </div> </div>page 28 in the manuscript-<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Of course, other hunters point fingers at the<br /> morally righteous members of the Long Night, Los Angelitos, and the <b><i>demon-hunting<br /> conspiracies Utopia Now </i></b>and the Knights of Saint Adrian as the main culprits. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T06:40:29-08:00","id":1366000,"title":"","content":"Don\u2019t get me wrong I am excited for the nine stars I just want to know how they will play and history. <br /> <br /> Also hell yeah Utopia now is a conspiracy. I hope that\u2019s just not a typo<br /> <br /> First stretch goal in less then 24 hours!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24179,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","user":"Grimmi05","date":". 02-07-2020, 09:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T07:07:34-08:00","id":1366007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grimmi05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366000#post1366000\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Don\u2019t get me wrong I am excited for the nine stars I just want to know how they will play and history. <br /> <br /> Also hell yeah Utopia now is a conspiracy. I hope that\u2019s just not a typo<br /> <br /> First stretch goal in less then 24 hours!</div> </div> </div> </div>where did you read that? honestly curious","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T07:15:39-08:00","id":1366009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366007#post1366007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> where did you read that? honestly curious</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Look back two or three posts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T07:28:58-08:00","id":1366011,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366009#post1366009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Look back two or three posts.</div> </div> </div> </div>ok, I saw it. my bad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T08:52:27-08:00","id":1366038,"title":"","content":"Hi everyone, I just wanted to pop in to say &quot;Thank you!&quot; for backing Hunter the Vigil Second Edition and making this a reality. Everyone appreciates the support and is very excited to blast through the stretch goals to ensure you get more Hunter goodness. Speaking as the developer, I hope you see yourself in this game and will find a way to uphold the Vigil. I can see you're having fun with the lore and there's a lot more to come! Keep those candles burning!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1870-mlvalentine","name":"mlvalentine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1870_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T09:17:42-08:00","id":1366045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mlvalentine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366038#post1366038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi everyone, I just wanted to pop in to say &amp;quot;Thank you!&amp;quot; for backing Hunter the Vigil Second Edition and making this a reality. Everyone appreciates the support and is very excited to blast through the stretch goals to ensure you get more Hunter goodness. Speaking as the developer, I hope you see yourself in this game and will find a way to uphold the Vigil. I can see you're having fun with the lore and there's a lot more to come! Keep those candles burning!</div> </div> </div> </div>and we all thank you and your team for taking the time to make this the best version of the game you can make!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T09:37:38-08:00","id":1366049,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mlvalentine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366038#post1366038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi everyone, I just wanted to pop in to say &quot;Thank you!&quot; for backing Hunter the Vigil Second Edition and making this a reality. Everyone appreciates the support and is very excited to blast through the stretch goals to ensure you get more Hunter goodness. Speaking as the developer, I hope you see yourself in this game and will find a way to uphold the Vigil. I can see you're having fun with the lore and there's a lot more to come! Keep those candles burning!</div> </div> </div> </div>It's great to see you stop by! I actually never really got into 1st edition but since then my curiosity grew so now I'll be eagerly waiting for the previews, particularly the Slashers!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T09:46:14-08:00","id":1366053,"title":"","content":"I like (what we know of) both Nine Stars and VASCU, but I\u2019m slightly disappointed that both the Slasher Chroncile groups are law enforcement. I\u2019d have hoped one would fill that niche, and the other could do something different. Off the top of my head, a feminist Compact in the Slasher Chronicle role could have been a good way to explore the underlying misogyny and sex politics of the Slasher genre.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 02-07-2020, 01:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T14:13:57-08:00","id":1366110,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366053#post1366053\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like (what we know of) both Nine Stars and VASCU, but I\u2019m slightly disappointed that both the Slasher Chroncile groups are law enforcement. I\u2019d have hoped one would fill that niche, and the other could do something different. Off the top of my head, a feminist Compact in the Slasher Chronicle role could have been a good way to explore the underlying misogyny and sex politics of the Slasher genre.</div> </div> </div> </div>They already kinda did that with the Maiden's Blood Sisterhood. Granted it wasn't slasher but vampire fiction also had underlying misogyny and sex politics in it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T14:27:33-08:00","id":1366117,"title":"","content":"I doubt we will have an essay on misogyny on slashers. it may have side bars about handling it, but I don't much else<br /> <br /> these books are meant to entertain, not preach.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T14:35:07-08:00","id":1366119,"title":"","content":"Can someone easily describe to me what <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/339646881/hunter-the-vigil-second-edition-tabletop-roleplaying-game/posts/2749699\" target=\"_blank\">this fiction</a>, exactly, means?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T15:47:37-08:00","id":1366141,"title":"","content":"Seems while fighting a Bishilu in Kuala Lampur a man's brother got lost in the shadow or gauntlet or where ever the werewolves have spirits. maybe became a claimed or something and contacted the narrator and we coming back into the world of the living. ??","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T16:09:25-08:00","id":1366146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366053#post1366053\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like (what we know of) both Nine Stars and VASCU, but I\u2019m slightly disappointed that both the Slasher Chroncile groups are law enforcement. I\u2019d have hoped one would fill that niche, and the other could do something different. Off the top of my head, a feminist Compact in the Slasher Chronicle role could have been a good way to explore the underlying misogyny and sex politics of the Slasher genre.</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe the closest quasi-official piece of writing that would fit that would be the <a href=\"https://vindae.tumblr.com/post/152871449610/the-toluca-lake-survivors-foundation?is_related_post=1\" target=\"_blank\">Final Girls' Club</a> compact as written by Aspel. They stated that they had to cut some talking points to fit the length requirements but it feels that it would eventually lead into some discussion about the nature of femininity in the Slasher genre.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1417-reaper-verse","name":"Reaper Verse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1417_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T16:10:09-08:00","id":1366147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366117#post1366117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I doubt we will have an essay on misogyny on slashers. it may have side bars about handling it, but I don't much else<br /> <br /> these books are meant to entertain, not preach.</div> </div> </div> </div>On the other hand, not tackling the politics of genre conceits has never been the Chronicle's style.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, people who are inclined to this particular point of view <i>really</i> aren't going to enjoy Hunter. Not that all of the games don't have politics (because they all do), but Hunter is <i>heavily</i> political, from <i>a lot</i> of angles, mostly because of how rooted in real human movements it is.<br /> <br /> I mean, there's a reason <i>my</i> least favorite compact is The Union, the open hilarity that the Maiden's Blood Sisterhood, Barrett Commission, and Night Angels are all basically socio-economic variants of the Union <i>for a reason</i>, and I honestly don't know how anyone reads The Long Night, Ashwood Abbey, the Loyalists of Thule, Network Zero, Null Mysteriis, Division Six, Keepers of the Source, Talbot Group, the Hunt Club, Habibti Ma, Utopia Now, Task Force Valkyrie, Malleus Maleficarum, The Ascending Ones, The Cheiron Group, the Cainite Conspiracy, VASCU, and the Knights of Saint Adrian and not pick up along the way of some of those that something is being said.<br /> <br /> That's because there is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 02-07-2020, 07:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T16:27:43-08:00","id":1366150,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366147#post1366147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On the other hand, not tackling the politics of genre conceits has never been the Chronicle's style.</div> </div> </div> </div>that is true. and perhaps will do so more in the corebook since the Slasher supplement avoided it. but, it being in the corebook is the reasoning I have that it wont be an aspect talked a out that much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T17:10:22-08:00","id":1366166,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366117#post1366117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I doubt we will have an essay on misogyny on slashers. it may have side bars about handling it, but I don't much else<br /> <br /> these books are meant to entertain, not preach.</div> </div> </div> </div>A sidebar just talking about the history of misogyny in the genre would be preaching. A compact of women fighting back against it would be entertaining and awesome response to that history.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T17:38:53-08:00","id":1366176,"title":"","content":"It would just be maiden\u2019s blood but instead of vampires it\u2019s slashers. It would just be retreading old ground.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T17:48:16-08:00","id":1366182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grimmi05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366176#post1366176\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It would just be maiden\u2019s blood but instead of vampires it\u2019s slashers. It would just be retreading old ground.</div> </div> </div> </div>that's not true, both the faithful of Shulpae and the promethean brotherhood seem to tread the same ground. yet the thematics are WAY different<br /> <br /> the brotherhood is full of spiteful, power hungry men and women who envy, hate, and murder mages for their power, all the while bring academic and also home to victims of mages (Sleepwalkers are not treated well more often than not)<br /> <br /> the Faithful worship the supernatural, they are powerful and beloved for what they can do. the faithful do not kill, they save their gods. they are religious, and to them, they are not being selfish or wanting power, they are simply being close to their gods.<br /> <br /> the blood maidens sisterhood is about saving those who are taken advantage of, not just women, but the young. it's less about the monster, and more about those they exploit.<br /> <br /> a slasher compact could easily go in a different direction.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1098_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1098\" data-vbnamecard=\"1098\">glamourweaver</a>, you have a point, and you meant by having a compact with these themes? in that case, I can get behind that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T18:07:15-08:00","id":1366185,"title":"","content":"Speaking of, I'm wondering how the Shulpites work in this new paradigm for hunters.<br /> <br /> I wonder if they feel that the monsters they actively hunt are those gods who have misused their position and need to serve the world in the best way they can. From a certain perspective, it's an act of mercy to free the divine spirit from a corrupted material shell to come back wiser and more humanitarian.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T18:12:39-08:00","id":1366189,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366185#post1366185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of, I'm wondering how the Shulpites work in this new paradigm for hunters.<br /> <br /> I wonder if they feel that the monsters they actively hunt are those gods who have misused their position and need to serve the world in the best way they can. From a certain perspective, it's an act of mercy to free the divine spirit from a corrupted material shell to come back wiser and more humanitarian.</div> </div> </div> </div>I <i>really hope not</i>. Closeness to the divine by way of cannibalism is <i>fucking cool</i>, and plays into the subversive element of the Feast of Shulpae as being dangerous because of their willingness to worship and commit hyper well. The Feast is dangerous because that is open Cult dots <i>right there</i>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366190#post1366190\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> to be honest I actually do like that idea, not necessarily because it's a fine idea, but the Faithful never really got a reason for what they did. I'm not asking for a good reason, but their write-up only went as far as &quot;its proper worship&quot;. even the cainites got a reason, being Crazy Revenge Driven Extremists.<br /> <br /> really, the more on the faithful the better (same on the brotherhood for me)</div> </div> </div> </div>V-It was because eating monsters was how they connected to the divine. It's spelled out hyper early.<br /> <br /> Religion is Great!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 02-07-2020, 09:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T18:14:01-08:00","id":1366190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366185#post1366185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of, I'm wondering how the Shulpites work in this new paradigm for hunters.<br /> <br /> I wonder if they feel that the monsters they actively hunt are those gods who have misused their position and need to serve the world in the best way they can. From a certain perspective, it's an act of mercy to free the divine spirit from a corrupted material shell to come back wiser and more humanitarian.</div> </div> </div> </div>to be honest I actually do like that idea, not necessarily because it's a fine idea, but the Faithful never really got a reason for what they did. I'm not asking for a good reason, but their write-up only went as far as &quot;its proper worship&quot;. even the cainites got a reason, being Crazy Revenge Driven Extremists.<br /> <br /> really, the more on the faithful the better (same on the brotherhood for me)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T18:44:07-08:00","id":1366200,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366189#post1366189\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I <i>really hope not</i>. Closeness to the divine by way of cannibalism is <i>fucking cool</i>, and plays into the subversive element of the Feast of Shulpae as being dangerous because of their willingness to worship and commit hyper well. The Feast is dangerous because that is open Cult dots <i>right there</i>.<br /> <br /> <br /> V-It was because eating monsters was how they connected to the divine. It's spelled out hyper early.<br /> <br /> Religion is Great!</div> </div> </div> </div>no no, I mean like further insight into why they do what they do. I'm still fine with them doing it because that's just how they worship. I've had much fun playing as them. I mean delving into what they think of the monsters actively resisting them and the monsters that are different from Mummies (and if they really dont give a shit that their actions can help humanity at times)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T19:13:48-08:00","id":1366209,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366189#post1366189\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I <i>really hope not</i>. Closeness to the divine by way of cannibalism is <i>fucking cool</i>, and plays into the subversive element of the Feast of Shulpae as being dangerous because of their willingness to worship and commit hyper well. The Feast is dangerous because that is open Cult dots <i>right there</i>.<br /> <br /> <br /> V-It was because eating monsters was how they connected to the divine. It's spelled out hyper early.<br /> <br /> Religion is Great!</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019ll also point out, besides the religious angle, the Faithful of Shulpae evoke something else appropriate to Mummy.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/history/the-gruesome-history-of-eating-corpses-as-medicine-82360284/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/histo...cine-82360284/</a><br /> <br /> People don\u2019t like to talk about how part of why there are so few remaining Egyptian mummies is because the oh so enlightened early modern Europeans ate them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T19:46:11-08:00","id":1366214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366209#post1366209\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I\u2019ll also point out, besides the religious angle, the Faithful of Shulpae evoke something else appropriate to Mummy.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;https://www.smithsonianmag.com/history/the-gruesome-history-of-eating-corpses-as-medicine-82360284/&amp;quot;\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/histo...cine-82360284/</a><br /> <br /> People don\u2019t like to talk about how part of why there are so few remaining Egyptian mummies is because the oh so enlightened early modern Europeans ate them.</div> </div> </div> </div>shulpae are far older though, it memory serves correct.<br /> <br /> I could be VERY wrong but I think 1st edition Sothis supplement has what's supposed to the first incarnation of the faithful of shulpae in it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T20:10:04-08:00","id":1366223,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366214#post1366214\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> shulpae are far older though, it memory serves correct.<br /> <br /> I could be VERY wrong but I think 1st edition Sothis supplement has what's supposed to the first incarnation of the faithful of shulpae in it</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but it can still evoke that thematically without it being their origin.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T20:22:12-08:00","id":1366226,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366223#post1366223\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, but it can still evoke that thematically without it being their origin.</div> </div> </div> </div>The thing about fiction is that it doesn't have to be as young as it actually is!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T20:25:09-08:00","id":1366228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366223#post1366223\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, but it can still evoke that thematically without it being their origin.</div> </div> </div> </div>I understand now. yeah I have no argument against that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T23:25:54-08:00","id":1366248,"title":"","content":"I am personally fond of the Faithful of Shulpae being a (series of) Shuankshen cult(s) that copied their dear leader before placing them on the dining table. Every so often, someone shuts them down, but the pattern repeats...<br /> All of which is irrelevant to this Kickstarter ATM and is my personal idea anyway. Your game, your rules after all.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, does anyone hope they changed anything about the returning Compacts &amp; Conspiracies? Or why that order for the names of those splats feels wrong?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T00:58:36-08:00","id":1366255,"title":"","content":"Well, the Faithful seems to be listed among the &quot;less virtuous&quot; hunter groups together with the Promethean Brotherhood, so I assume they are as hungry for the flesh of the gods as ever. I assume that whatever practices they and the Brotherhood have, they are different enough to stop them from merging like some other groups do (which I like, Having them turning into a single group and/or killing one of them off would have made me cringe a bit)<br /> <br /> As for the order of the splats name= isn't is alphabetical, with the exception of VASCU and Nine Stars, which come at a different chapter?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T02:42:13-08:00","id":1366264,"title":"","content":"Does anyone know how good the quality of the Storyteller Screen will be? <br /> I still own the thick and sturdy Screen from the first edition of the new World Of Darkness. So when I received my copy of the \u201cChangeling: The Lost - Storyteller Screen\u201d, it was a huge disappointment! It\u2019s very thin and looks already very used on the edges while the old one still looks like new... It also contains only three pages instead of four.. \ud83d\ude15","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Waiting for new Chronicles of Darkness Dice! \ud83e\udd17 \ud83c\udfb2","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1825-elythia","name":"Elythia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1825_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T04:10:21-08:00","id":1366292,"title":"","content":"The Long Night &amp; The Ascending Ones previews have dropped on Kickstarter. Let\u2019s read new write ups of them\u2026<br /> <br /> EDIT: General notes - The text shows that there are more monsters in the universe than ever before. <b>Mechanics: </b>The status in the organization again gives benefits on the first, third and fifth dots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-08-2020, 07:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T04:47:13-08:00","id":1366295,"title":"","content":"Compressed quotes from their write-up of most interesting tibits. It's much smaller compliation of what new write-up is about. The whole write-up takes up to 6 pages per organisation.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Long Night \u2013 Tribulation Army</b></span><br /> Mix of survivalist movements of 1970s, gun-worshipping cults and anti-government doomsday preppers that have fought alongside ultra-conservative \u201cfamily values\u201d campaigners,affluent Southern fundamentalists, and middle-class Midwestern evangelicals. Now, members of the Long Night have spread beyond the southern United States. They tend to cluster around notable preachers in states like California and Texas, but may be found in Northern Ireland, New Zealand, Australia, and England.<br /> What they share is a belief in God and the grim philosophy that Satan is winning \u2014 and it will take more than guns and their tight-knit communities to drive the devil back to hell. Hunters in the Long Night do not share one nationality, one belief in God, or one view of the Code. When hunting, the Long Night views the war against the supernatural as their God-given duty. Though some members are convinced the Tribulation must happen before humanity can spiritually evolve, they fear the costs of the war more than they\u2019d care to admit. Some members see the source of monsters as the seven deadly sins \u2014 wrath, lust, sloth, pride, gluttony, envy, and greed \u2014 as proof that demons are not a figment of a good Christian\u2019s imagination, and they could be to blame for the creation of new monsters. Many hunters are convinced that wicked or cursed mortals, namely warlocks, witches, mediums, fae-touched victims, and some slashers can be saved, if not redeemed. The Long Night\u2019s members work tirelessly to hunt and convert.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-08-2020, 08:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T05:19:33-08:00","id":1366297,"title":"","content":"Ascending Ones write-up compilation - after them there are also Endowments rules.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ascending Ones \u2013 The Cult of the Phoenix </span></b><br /> In prehistoric Egypt there were two brotherhoods \u2013 Cult of Pheonix and Cult of Set. First hunted monsters in day, second \u2013 in the night. But Cult of Set becomes corrupted and joined monsters in the night. Elders of Pheonix made elixirs for them \u2013 and rest is just history now. ( Not real quotes, just sum up of Conspiracy history. )<br /> Once the alchemists built a stable of potions that yielded predictable results, their methodology remained stable for 1,000 years. The Ascending Ones spread their influence from Egypt into other parts of North Africa, the Middle East, and into Roman-occupied territories; they courted members who hailed from different faiths, incorporating the followers of Christ, Muhammad, Hermes, Horus, Ashoka and others. ( <b>Wyrd</b>\u2019s notice: They have also high numbers in Hermeticism and similar traditions. ) They no longer possess the freedoms they once enjoyed in ancient times to distribute narcotics, alcohol, and illicit herbs. Some members have turned to organized crime to sell drugs while others sell formulas and rare plants to pharmaceutical companies. Most members apply their alchemical knowledge to a trade of some kind; this allows them to remain vigilant while earning a living. In recent months, leaders have grown concerned that their organization is at great risk of falling prey to the same forces that claimed the Cult of Set so long ago. Not only have they tasked the Ascending Ones to walk a righteous path, they\u2019ve also been keen to check in with members more frequently by conducting face-to-face meetings. Alchemists whisper that their leaders are up to something, but don\u2019t possess the means to unlock their secrets \u2014 yet.<br /> Time and experience have taught members that monsters don\u2019t always have to be slayed; some can be reasoned with, others can be calmed or convinced that murdering people is not in its best interests. When war is brewing, a designated alchemist acts as an intermediary and engages in diplomacy to broker a peace between monster factions in an Arabic tradition called <i>Sulha</i>. Much like a cop trying to mediate a fight between rival mobsters, the Ascending Ones know neither side is without sin, but they also know a battle would claim innocent lives.<br /> Despite the organization\u2019s history, the Ascending Ones do not possess an encyclopedic knowledge of monsters or their societies. In part, this lack of understanding is because most cells operate independently of one another, and it is very rare that the organization gives a top-down order.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-08-2020, 08:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T09:46:28-08:00","id":1366342,"title":"","content":"I was curious how the Long Night would be handled. I think I have a better read on them this time around (though my personal relationship to their source material definitely colored/colors my interpretation of the group). I wonder what the Venn Diagram of &quot;fans of the Chronicles of Darkness&quot; and &quot;fans of <i>Left Behind</i>&quot; looks like, anyway.<br /> <br /> What's up with the carrying capacity rule for Elixirs? Do you have to achieve a certain level of mystical enlightenment and/or physical health before you can stash an extra vial in your backpack? Or does that sentence refer to the number of potions you can imbibe at once?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T10:43:48-08:00","id":1366353,"title":"","content":"I presume it's a just mechanical conceit so that a single hunter of the Ascending Ones doesn't overshadow someone from VALKYRIE by combining every single Elixir and becoming some sort of one-man army (though that would be neat).<br /> <br /> <br /> While the write-ups currently lack Stereotypes on the other organizations, I'm pleasantly surprised that the Conspiracies are actually receiving a tangible bonus for their first dot in Status rather than just unlocking access to their Endowments. It's also interesting to see that Elixirs aren't gated by level and are instead policed by how intense their drawbacks are to the power of the Elixir. I wonder if this framework will also shape the rest of the Endowments we'll see.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1417-reaper-verse","name":"Reaper Verse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1417_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T11:40:21-08:00","id":1366362,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reaper Verse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366353#post1366353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I presume it's a just mechanical conceit so that a single hunter of the Ascending Ones doesn't overshadow someone from VALKYRIE by combining every single Elixir and becoming some sort of one-man army (though that would be neat).<br /> <br /> <br /> While the write-ups currently lack Stereotypes on the other organizations, I'm pleasantly surprised that the Conspiracies are actually receiving a tangible bonus for their first dot in Status rather than just unlocking access to their Endowments. It's also interesting to see that Elixirs aren't gated by level and are instead policed by how intense their drawbacks are to the power of the Elixir. I wonder if this framework will also shape the rest of the Endowments we'll see.</div> </div> </div> </div>I miss the stereotypes, but that is an extremely minor thing. I actually like our very first look into compacts and conspiracies <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar99_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"99\" data-vbnamecard=\"99\">ArcaneArts</a>, just wondering, how are you liking it so far? straying from 1st edition or keeping in the themes for you? personally, I think it's being consistent, and I'm happy with that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T12:20:30-08:00","id":1366369,"title":"","content":"In KS campaign, we also collect the bundle of 1E PDFs to buy in... <b>At $60,000 in funding - New Add-On Reward:</b> The Ascending Ones' Archive \u2014 We\u2019ll create a PDF bundle of first-edition titles that can be added to any reward tier for only $3. This PDF bundle will include:<ul><li><b>Night Stalkers</b> [Hunter: The Vigil 1E] PDF</li> <li><b> Blood Drive</b> [Hunter: The Vigil 1E] PDF</li> <li><b>Dark Eras: Fallen Blossoms</b> [Hunter: The Vigil 1E] PDF</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T12:24:01-08:00","id":1366372,"title":"","content":"Monica Valentinelli, lead developer of <b>HtV</b> 2E, made interviews with her own team on subjects of new corebook - <a href=\"http://www.flamesrising.com/htv2e-kickstarter-interview-mysterious-places/\" target=\"_blank\">this time it's Mysterious Places</a>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T12:36:57-08:00","id":1366377,"title":"","content":"Writing up org stereotypes could be a fun fan project.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T12:48:06-08:00","id":1366381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366377#post1366377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Writing up org stereotypes could be a fun fan project.</div> </div> </div> </div>agreed, I'm terrible at making them though","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T14:09:50-08:00","id":1366396,"title":"","content":"so are the stereotypes gone just because there are so many splats?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T14:23:43-08:00","id":1366399,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grimmi05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1364695-hunter-the-vigil-2e-kickstarter?p=1366396#post1366396\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">so are the stereotypes gone just because there are so many splats?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that didn't stop 1e, so I think that's not the reason","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-